```

Webpack version is 1.13.1
I am not sure but I think that the problem is in the https://github.com/webpack/webpack/blob/master/lib/RecordIdsPlugin.js#L13 line. As I see the function "makeRelative" should split each item from the result of the 1st splitting (instead of double-splitting of identifier):

```
function makeRelative(compiler, identifier) {
    var context = compiler.context;
    return identifier.split("|").map(function(str) {
        return str.split("!").map(function(str) {
            return path.relative(context, str);
        }).join("!");
    }).join("|");
}
```
